Task:  Change the instance type from t2.micro to t2.nano for xfusion-ec2 instance.
Solution: 
Go to EC2 - Edit the EC2 instance
1) Change the instance type from t2.micro to t2.nano for xfusion-ec2 instance (change the state to stop first)
2) Make sure the ec2 instance xfusion-ec2 is in running state after the change.
